### Interaction Patterns

**Auto-match single candidate:**
- Pre-selected on load; `Button variant="filled"` Confirm enabled immediately
- Single candidate only — binary model; no alternative candidates shown in auto-match panel

**EMIS Web register search:**
- Input debounced 300ms; minimum 2 characters before search fires
- Results replace previous results; loading skeleton shown during fetch
- "No results" state after search with no matches
- Selecting a result auto-scrolls to footer; Confirm button enables

**Confirm match:**
- On confirm: `Notification variant="success"` `{t('matching.confirmed', { name })}`
- StepIndicator Step 1 icon changes to ✓; Step 2 tab unlocks
- Patient Banner populates with matched patient details across all subsequent steps

